<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Wheelock.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Wheelock.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Friday it has issued 380 million American-style call warrants on shares of Wheelock and Co Ltd .</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$25.41	 PREMIUM	  25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3465	GEARING	  6.66X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98	PAYDATE	  17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE   19.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$23.10	 MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> NOTES		 CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF</p>
<p>			 STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
